.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The classical Gaussian ensembles GOE/GUE/GSE only exist at Dyson index \beta = 1, 2, 4, and are conventionally built as dense n \times n matrices costing O(n^3) to diagonalize. Dumitriu and Edelman (2002) showed that the tridiagonal matrix">

